firefox-addons:918555.description:
AliExpress in just one click! Receive notifications of new messages directly in Firefox and don't miss any promotion!
- Compare prices;
- Track your orders;
- Get exclusive discounts;
- Search anywhere for products;
- Receive notifications about promotions;
- See similar products to compare prices;
- See products that match what you like;
- Receive notifications of new messages;
Search instantly and shop easily on AliExpress, the world's biggest online marketing place!
One of the most downloaded apps from the Windows Store now in Firefox.
IMPORTANT:
* This extension uses the following affiliate programs: AliExpress, Amazon, Banggood and Shopee. By installing and using it, you agree to replace the links on these sites with affiliate links.
* Affiliate links do not generate any additional cost to the user.

bluejetty:00026076:ios.description:
Train and get closer to your dog by playing using Dog Training game with your pet.
Dog Training Game Content & Main Features:
– 50+ Dog Sounds;
– 45+ Dog Training Articles – know how to train your dog from basic to advanced commands and more;
– Training Whistle – train your dog with an ultrasonic whistle;
– No ads!
Note that free version of the game is limited to:
– 5 Dog Sounds;
– 1 Dog Training Article;
– 1 Whistle Use.
If you want to use the game without limits an auto-renewable subscription ”Dog Training Premium” is available.
Auto-renewable Subscription ”Dog Training Premium” Info:
By subscribing you get premium (full, unlimited) access to all the features and content offered by Dog Training game.
Auto-renewable Subscription “Dog Training Premium” Includes:
– Unlock All Sounds;
– Unlock All Training Articles;
– Unlimited Whistle Use;
The game contains the following auto-renewable subscription called ”Dog Training Premium”:
– Weekly (0,99 US$) with a 3-days for free period.
* Subscription price may vary depending on your location;
* Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;
* Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;
* Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;
* Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account;
* Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.
Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/dog-training-privacy/
Terms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/

